---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Client Reviews | ATECT Architecture"
  description="Client feedback and published testimonials for ATECT Architecture."
>
  <section class="page-hero review-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Client Reviews</div>
    <h1>Built on trust. Designed with purpose.</h1>
    <p>
      Every project begins with listening, collaboration, and a clear understanding
      of the client's goals. These testimonials reflect experiences published by
      ATECT Architecture's clients.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section reviews-section">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Client Experience</div>
        <h2>What our clients have shared.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        ATECT Architecture believes the finished project is only part of the
        experience. Communication, professionalism, and thoughtful design matter
        throughout the process.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="review-grid">
      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="quote-mark">“</div>
        <blockquote>
          Mr. Jones has been very professional as he provided the architect
          drawings for an addition of a Sunroom and Screened patio for my home.
        </blockquote>
        <div class="attribution">
          <span class="client-name">D. Trott</span>
          <span class="client-label">Published client testimonial</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="quote-mark">“</div>
        <blockquote>
          I greatly appreciate all your help. I will definitely recommend your
          company to others.
        </blockquote>
        <div class="attribution">
          <span class="client-name">R. Staiger</span>
          <span class="client-label">Published client testimonial</span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="review-note">
      These testimonials are presented as published by ATECT Architecture.
      Additional client feedback can be added as authentic testimonials are
      approved for publication.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="experience-section">
    <div class="experience-content">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">The ATECT Approach</div>
        <h2>From the first conversation to the completed design.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Whether a project involves a residential addition, a new home, or
        commercial design services, ATECT Architecture works to turn the client's
        goals into a coordinated architectural solution and clear construction
        documentation.
      </p>
      <a class="button dark" href="/process">Explore Our Process</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <div class="eyebrow">Start a Conversation</div>
    <h2>Ready to discuss your project?</h2>
    <p>Let's talk about your goals, your property, and what comes next.</p>
    <a class="button dark" href="/contact">Start Your Project</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .review-hero {
    padding-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .review-hero p {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .reviews-section {
    padding-top: 76px;
    padding-bottom: 82px;
  }

  .section-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.75fr;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
  }

  .section-intro h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .section-intro p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .review-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .review-card {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 360px;
    padding: 48px;
    background: #f5f5f2;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .review-card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 72px;
    height: 4px;
    background: #222;
  }

  .quote-mark {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 86px;
    line-height: 0.65;
    color: #999;
  }

  .review-card blockquote {
    margin: 28px 0 42px;
    max-width: 650px;
    font: 500 clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px) / 1.4 Manrope, sans-serif;
    color: #222;
  }

  .attribution {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #d5d5d0;
  }

  .client-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .client-label {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .review-note {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .experience-section {
    background: #f5f5f2;
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 82px 6vw;
  }

  .experience-content {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.75fr auto;
    gap: 55px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .experience-content h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .experience-content p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 96px 6vw;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    margin: 10px 0 14px;
  }

  .cta p {
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    max-width: 620px;
    color: #666;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .section-intro,
    .experience-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .experience-content .button {
      justify-self: start;
    }

    .review-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .review-card {
      min-height: 320px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .review-card {
      padding: 34px 28px;
    }

    .reviews-section,
    .experience-section,
    .cta {
      padding-top: 62px;
      padding-bottom: 62px;
    }
  }
</style>
